acity=".85"/><path d="M84 106 q0-6 6-6 h12 l6 6 h12 l6-6 h88 q6 0 6 6 v20 q0 6-6 6 h-88 l-6 6 h-12 l-6-6 h-12 q-6 0-6-6z" fill="#1f8b3f"/><rect x="98" y="111" width="58" height="6" rx="3" fill="#ffffff" opacity=".85"/><path d="M58 24 v104" stroke="#1f8b3f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M58 24 h26 l-6 9 6 9 h-26z" fill="#2e86c9"/><circle cx="262" cy="44" r="16" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1f8b3f" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M256 44 l10-6 v12z" fill="#1f8b3f"/></svg></span><span class="body"><span class="tags"><span class="tag">Scratch</span><span class="tag b">Học sinh tiểu học</span></span><h3>Scratch cho thiếu nhi</h3><p>Bắt đầu hành trình lập trình bằng các khối lệnh kéo thả vui nhộn.</p><span class="meta"><span><b>5</b> chủ đề</span><span><b>Online</b>, có kèm 1 - 1</span></span><span class="go">Xem chi tiết khóa học</span></span></a><a class="course reveal" href="/khoa-hoc-python"><span class="art"><svg viewBox="0 0 320 150" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="320" height="150" fill="#eef7f1"/><rect x="56" y="22" width="208" height="110" rx="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#2e86c9" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="56" y="22" width="208" height="22" rx="12" fill="#2e86c9"/><rect x="56" y="34" width="208" height="10" fill="#2e86c9"/><circle cx="72" cy="33" r="4" fill="#ffffff"/><circle cx="85" cy="33" r="4" fill="#ffffff" opacity=".7"/><circle cx="98" cy="33" r="4" fill="#ffffff" opacity=".5"/><rect x="74" y="58" width="60" height="8" rx="4" fill="#1f8b3f"/><rect x="140" y="58" width="80" height="8" rx="4" fill="#cfe3d6"/><rect x="90" y="76" width="96" height="8" rx="4" fill="#2e86c9" opacity=".7"/><rect x="90" y="94" width="70" height="8" rx="4" fill="#cfe3d6"/><rect x="74" y="112" width="40" height="8" rx="4" fill="#1f8b3f"/><circle cx="250" cy="118" r="20" fill="#1f8b3f"/><path d="M241 118 l6 6 l12-13" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span cl